! SEIDEL: Seidel, wavefront, transverse and longitudinal coefficient tables
! (OpticStudio's Seidel Coefficients) for the book's f/2.5 singlet at 10 deg,
! C d F.  Transverse sums equal THO's: TSPH = SA, TTCO = TCO, TTFC = TAS,
! TSFC = SAS, TPFC = PTB, TDIS = DST, TAXC = AX, TLAC = LAT.
LEN NEW
TIT 'OSDsinglet'
EPD 20
INS S2
RDY S1 120
THI S1 5
GLA S1 NBK7
RDY S2 -32.4637
PIM
YAN 0 7 10
WL 656.27 587.56 486.13
SEIDEL ; GO
! the Seidel and wavefront tables in waves
SEIDEL ; SUNIT WAVES ; GO
THO
! bad input
SUNIT WAVES
SEIDEL ; SUNIT FURLONGS ; GO
